[[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the vehicle on a lift.</p><p>Raise the car.</p><p>1. Working on the front right side of the engine compartment, disconnect\nhorn electrical connections (1a) and (1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Horn</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428736\">P5A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Horn</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428737\">P5B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the bolt fixing the horn.</p><p>3. Remove the horn.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2045068.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the horns is  not\ndamaged and test their operation.</p><p>Refit the horn fixing it using the nut.</p><p>Connect the electrical connections .</p><p>Lower the vehicle.</p><p>Remove the vehicle from the lift.</p>"]]